.env
.env.*
!.env.example
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.cache/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

# Atlas Layer 1 run artifacts (regenerable; not source)
output/*.json
output/runs/
output/latest.html
!output/.gitkeep

# output/ledger.jsonl is deliberately NOT ignored: the forward outcome
# ledger is constitutionally required to be permanently archived and
# never deleted (Amendment No.2, 修正案五) - unlike the regenerable
# artifacts above, it's the one output/ file that belongs in version
# control (git's append-friendly, auditable history matches the
# constitution's "全量归档,永不删除" requirement well).

# design-demos/screenshots/ — regenerable, so kept out of version control
# for the same reason as the output/ artifacts above. The demo HTML files
# themselves ARE committed, and _shared-spec.md carries both the real
# report data they render and the exact Playwright command that produced
# each capture, so any screenshot here can be rebuilt from what is
# tracked. (report-v2-preview*.png come from scripts/preview-report.ts
# against a saved run rather than from a demo file — those two are only
# reproducible while that run's data is still in the local output/runs/.)
design-demos/screenshots/
